# The Dockerfile pins its own compiler (`FROM rust:<ver>`) for the published
# amt-verify binary. In the build context, rust-toolchain.toml would outrank that
# pin through the image's rustup proxy, so the image would be built by a compiler
# its own Dockerfile does not name. The two versions are held EQUAL by
# tests/toolchain_pin_test.sh (BLO-42208); this exclusion is what makes that
# equality the reason the image is on that compiler, rather than a coincidence
# that would survive the Dockerfile being bumped.
rust-toolchain.toml
